      <activity id="4e307185-82b8-5741-91c7-3f37985f3ab2" activityNameId="eb703311-a235-56f7-b9db-bf091bb42c71" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, passenger ship</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, passenger ship
The energy consumption and the vessel demand was determined using data of the yearyl transport performance (150200000 pkm) and total kilometric transport performance(2257000vkm) provided in the BFS statistic 2015.;
UUID: 50d1c661-6536-3961-83b0-043c7bc89cda
Included is the vessel production, diesl consumption and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Sampling Procedure 
Extrapolations: Ship manufacture modelled with regional train and barge manufacture, extrapolated by weight
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_50d1c661-6536-3961-83b0-043c7bc89cda.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
